{"info": {"address1": "Sangam House", "address2": "Chittorgarh Road Atun", "city": "Bhilwara", "zip": "311001", "country": "India", "phone": "91 14 8224 5400", "fax": "91 14 8224 5450", "website": "https://www.sangamgroup.com", "industry": "Textile Manufacturing", "industryKey": "textile-manufacturing", "industryDisp": "Textile Manufacturing", "sector": "Consumer Cyclical", "sectorKey": "consumer-cyclical", "sectorDisp": "Consumer Cyclical", "longBusinessSummary": "Sangam (India) Limited manufactures and sells PV-dyed yarns and denim fabrics in India. Its product portfolio includes PV-blended dyed fabrics, synthetic ring spun yarns, fancy yarns, ring and open-ended cotton yarns, indigo dyed yarns, cotton and synthetic blended knitted fabrics, and suiting and shirting fabrics; seamless knitting fabrics; denim fabrics; and polyester/viscose, polyester/cotton, PV lycra, and polyester woollen products, as well as inner, active, and casual wear for men and women. The company also generates solar power with an installed capacity of 17 MW and wind power with 5 MW, as well as thermal power. It sells its products under the C9 Air wear, Sangam Suiting, and Sangam Denim brands. The company also exports its products. Sangam (India) Limited was incorporated in 1984 and is headquartered in Bhilwara, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ram Pal Soni", "age": 79, "title": "Founder & Chairman", "yearBorn": 1946, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 34948000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Anurag  Soni", "age": 37, "title": "MD & Whole Time Director", "yearBorn": 1988, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 8954000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Dr. Shri Niwas Modani M.B.A., M.Sc.", "age": 61, "title": "Whole Time Vice Chairman", "yearBorn": 1964, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 20064000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Anil  Sharma", "age": 61, "title": "Pres